<figure class="routing" aria-labelledby="routing-title">
  <figcaption id="routing-title"><span>COMPILE-TIME ROUTE</span><strong>One executable root, one selected application</strong></figcaption>
  <ol>
    <li><span>01</span><strong><code>build_config</code></strong><small><code>exe_entrypoint = .ghostty</code></small></li>
    <li><span>02</span><strong><code>main.zig</code></strong><small>selects a module at compile time</small></li>
    <li><span>03</span><strong><code>main_ghostty.zig</code></strong><small>exports the selected <code>main</code></small></li>
    <li><span>04</span><strong><code>App</code></strong><small>runs the existing lifecycle</small></li>
  </ol>
  <p>No runtime condition is evaluated. Zig compiles the selected module into the executable and leaves unselected entrypoints out.</p>
</figure>
